---
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import AboutImag from "@/assets/depot-one.jpg";
---

<section id="about" class="py-16 bg-gray-100 min-h-[36rem] scroll-mt-52">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center">
            <div class="md:w-1/2 mb-8 md:mb-0">
                <Image
                    width={600}
                    height={400}
                    src={AboutImag}
                    alt="Our workshop"
                    class="rounded-lg shadow-lg"
                />
            </div>
            <div class="md:w-1/2 md:pl-12">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">About Sumpreme Granite</h2>
                <p class="mb-6 text-gray-600">
                    We aim to provide a custom experience by guiding our
                    customers through every step of the process. Our customers
                    get to walk through our slab yard and pick out the exact
                    stone that’ll be cut and turned into a piece of their home.
                    Our salespeople are extremely knowledgeable and can answer
                    any and all questions that you may have, and our installers
                    are all professionals of the highest caliber and will make
                    sure that by the time they leave your home it looks better
                    than when they arrived. Our mission is to provide the
                    quickest fabrication timelines, highest quality
                    installations, and the largest selection of materials for
                    any countertop project they can dream of.
                </p>
                <p class="mb-6 text-gray-600">
                    We are constantly finding ways to improve our customer
                    service as well as offering a satisfaction guarantee. Our
                    services vary so we can cover most of your needs made by
                    different brands in the market, American or European made.
                    We are fabricators and installers of the following brand
                    materials: Granite, Curava, Cosentino, Sensa, Marble,
                    Travertine, Dekton, Silestone, Viatera, Ceasarstone,
                    Cambria, Quartz, and others. Our promise is to deliver an
                    unrivaled customer experience, by employing highly skilled
                    and well trained experts that provide superior, quality
                    craftsmanship. Visit our showroom. Choose your countertops
                    today.
                </p>
                <Button>Learn More About Us</Button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
